<view class="page">
  <view class="card intro-card">
    <view class="step">02 / 02</view>
    <view class="h2">算法眼中的你</view>
    <view class="muted">下面不是一组静态标签，而是一条条从你的真实线索向外扩散的推断路径。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="summary card">
    <view>
      <view class="summary-number">{{profile.length}}</view>
      <view class="summary-label">个推断节点</view>
    </view>
    <view class="summary-divider"></view>
    <view>
      <view class="summary-number">{{maxDepth}}</view>
      <view class="summary-label">最大推断层级</view>
    </view>
    <view class="summary-divider"></view>
    <view>
      <view class="summary-number">{{visibleDepth}}</view>
      <view class="summary-label">当前展开层级</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="graph-card card">
    <view class="graph-head">
      <view>
        <view class="layer-title">人物推断图谱</view>
        <view class="graph-subtitle">从“你做过什么”到“算法可能怎么理解你”</view>
      </view>
      <button class="replay-button" bindtap="replay">重播</button>
    </view>

    <view class="legend">
      <view class="legend-item"><view class="legend-dot input-dot"></view>用户线索</view>
      <view class="legend-item"><view class="legend-dot inference-dot"></view>中间推断</view>
      <view class="legend-item"><view class="legend-dot dimension-dot"></view>人格维度</view>
    </view>

    <scroll-view class="graph-scroll" scroll-x="true" enhanced="true" show-scrollbar="false">
      <canvas
        canvas-id="profileGraph"
        class="graph-canvas"
        style="width: {{graphWidth}}px; height: {{graphHeight}}px;"
      ></canvas>
    </scroll-view>

    <view class="graph-status" wx:if="{{!animationDone}}">
      正在展开第 {{visibleDepth}} 层推断…
    </view>
    <view class="graph-status done" wx:else>
      推断链路已展开完成
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{profile.length === 0}}" class="card muted">
    当前线索还没有形成足够强的推断。返回上一页换一组线索试试。
  </view>

  <view class="persona-card card">
    <view class="persona-kicker">阶段性数字人格</view>
    <view class="persona-title">{{persona.title}}</view>
    <view class="persona-summary">{{persona.summary}}</view>

    <view class="persona-meta">
      <view>行为证据 {{persona.evidenceTotal}} 条</view>
      <view>画像完整度 {{persona.completeness}}%</view>
    </view>

    <view class="persona-progress">
      <view class="persona-progress-fill" style="width: {{persona.completeness}}%;"></view>
    </view>

    <view class="dimension-list">
      <view wx:for="{{persona.items}}" wx:key="id" class="dimension-row {{item.evidenceCount === 0 ? 'dimension-inactive' : ''}}">
        <view class="dimension-head">
          <view>
            <view class="dimension-name">{{item.label}}</view>
            <view class="dimension-desc">{{item.evidenceCount > 0 ? item.descriptor : '证据不足'}}</view>
          </view>
          <view class="dimension-score">{{item.evidenceCount > 0 ? item.score : '--'}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="dimension-track">
          <view class="dimension-mid"></view>
          <view wx:if="{{item.evidenceCount > 0}}" class="dimension-fill" style="width: {{item.score}}%;"></view>
        </view>
        <view class="dimension-axis">
          <view>{{item.lowLabel}}</view>
          <view>{{item.highLabel}}</view>
        </view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.evidenceCount > 0}}" class="dimension-evidence">
          <view wx:for="{{item.evidence}}" wx:key="tagId" class="evidence-chip">{{item.tagLabel}} · +{{item.delta}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="persona-note">这不是心理学人格测评。当前分数只表示你主动提供的行为证据在这套模拟维度中的位置，后续线索增加后会变化。</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{profile.length > 0}}" class="detail-title">推断依据</view>

  <view wx:for="{{profile}}" wx:key="id" class="node-card depth-{{item.depth}}">
    <view class="node-head">
      <view class="node-main">
        <view class="depth-label">第 {{item.depth}} 层推断</view>
        <view class="node-title">{{item.label}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="score">{{item.score}}%</view>
    </view>

    <view class="confidence-track">
      <view class="confidence-fill" style="width: {{item.score}}%;"></view>
    </view>

    <view class="reason">为什么：{{item.reasons[0]}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card disclaimer">
    <view class="disclaimer-title">这不是事实判断</view>
    <view class="muted">这里的百分比只是当前模拟规则中的推断强度。越往外扩散，不确定性越高；它展示的是“算法可能如何推断”，不是对你的真实身份或人格下结论。</view>
  </view>

  <button class="primary" bindtap="again">换一组线索再试</button>
</view>
